## 📋 SPRINT METADATA

### Scope Lock Rules (AUDIT-ENFORCED)

| Rule | Enforcement |
|------|-------------|
| **NO** modifications to `(admin)`, `(store)`, `(studio)` | Route groups isolated — existing code protected |
| **NO** modifications to `data/*` outside `data/portfolio/` | Existing VFS/catalogue data protected |
| **NO** modifications to `app/components/*` (164 items) | Use `app/(portfolio)/components/` |
| **NO** changes to `tailwind.config.ts` | Extend via `(portfolio)/globals.css` only |
| **NO** modifications to build scripts | Work with existing prebuild pipeline |
| **YES** all work in `app/(portfolio)/` | Route group isolation mandatory |
| **YES** verify breakpoints before responsive work | Pre-step for SC3 (document above) |
| **YES** install missing dependencies first | `framer-motion`, `lucide-react` |

