  - [ ] Reduced motion test: static display when enabled
  - [ ] Animation completes in 3s

**Delegation:**
```
/implement "Create ScreenSafeTyping.tsx in app/(portfolio)/components/diamond/ with CSS steps() typing animation. CRITICAL: Use aria-hidden on visual animation + sr-only parallel content for screen readers. Implement useReducedMotion() check for static fallback. Add CSS keyframes to (portfolio)/globals.css. Test: Enable VoiceOver, verify complete code announced once (not 'c... co... con...')."
