## ⚠️ REGRESSION CONTAINMENT (AUDIT-UPDATED)

### Files at Risk

| File | Risk | Mitigation |
|------|------|------------|
| `app/(store)/*` | Route pollution | Keep all work in `(portfolio)/` |
| `app/(admin)/*` | Route pollution | Keep all work in `(portfolio)/` |
| `data/catalogue/*` | Data corruption | Use `data/portfolio/` subfolder |
| `tailwind.config.ts` | Design system drift | Extend via CSS only, no config changes |
| `package.json` | Dependency conflicts | Add only, never remove |

### Pre-Sprint Baseline

```bash
# EXECUTE BEFORE DAY 1:
git checkout -b portfolio-sprint-2026-04-02
npm install framer-motion@^11.0.0 lucide-react
npm run build
# CAPTURE BASELINE — must pass
```

### Regression Test Suite

```typescript
// tests/e2e/portfolio/regression.spec.ts
test.describe('Portfolio Regression', () => {
  test('build passes', async () => {
    const build = spawn('npm', ['run', 'build']);
    await expect(build).toExit(0);
  });
  
  test('route accessible', async ({ page }) => {
    const response = await page.goto('/portfolio');
    expect(response?.status()).toBe(200);
  });
  
  test('existing routes untouched', async ({ page }) => {
    // Verify /store still works
    const response = await page.goto('/store');
    expect(response?.status()).toBe(200);
  });
});
```

